      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We read with great interest the article by Solomon and colleagues (1). This randomized controlled trial does not find any significant effect of teriparatide (TPTD) on bone erosions in patients with Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA). In our opinion, it is not surprising that TPTD does not achieve the expected result. A few consideration can explain the negative experience with TPTD. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved."
      },
